<title>SINGAPORE: Samsung to start up aromatics complex in end July.</title>
<headline>Samsung to start up aromatics complex in end July.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung General Chemicals Co, an unlisted affiliate of Samsung Group, plans to start up its US$875 million integrated aromatics complex in end July, a company official said on Monday.</p>
</text>
